WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.376 --> 00:00:13.763
Roxy was under a huge pile of rocks.

2
00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:19.306
"It's a good thing I'm Rocket Girl," thought Roxy.

3
00:00:19.326 --> 00:00:21.567
"I didn't get hurt at all.

4
00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:25.569
But how will I stop the mole men from destroying Metro City?"

5
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.911
She thought for a moment.

6
00:00:27.931 --> 00:00:29.912
"I have an idea!"

7
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:33.209
Again Roxy spun fast.

8
00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:38.130
She drilled into the ground below the cave.

9
00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.271
Roxy listened carefully.

10
00:00:42.071 --> 00:00:43.452
She heard the mole men above her.

11
00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:47.033
"Where did the human go?"

12
00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:47.873
one asked.

13
00:00:47.893 --> 00:00:51.754
"I trapped her under that pile of rocks!"

14
00:00:52.134 --> 00:00:53.515
said the mole man near the machine.

15
00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.256
Roxy looked up, using her x-ray vision.

16
00:00:59.424 --> 00:01:01.745
The mole men started searching through the pile of rocks.

17
00:01:04.946 --> 00:01:07.086
She could also see the bottom of the earthquake machine.

18
00:01:07.106 --> 00:01:12.227
"I need to destroy that machine," thought Roxy.

19
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:14.768
She blasted up toward the machine.

20
00:01:17.049 --> 00:01:22.390
Boom! Roxy burst through the cave's floor and smashed the machine to pieces.

21
00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:27.031
"She destroyed our earthquake machine!"

22
00:01:27.231 --> 00:01:27.932
cried a mole man.

23
00:01:29.356 --> 00:01:30.157
"Get her!"

24
00:01:30.397 --> 00:01:31.238
shouted another one.

25
00:01:32.419 --> 00:01:34.100
The mole men rushed toward Roxy.

26
00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.002
Roxy flew up into the air.

27
00:01:37.923 --> 00:01:40.825
The mole men ran straight into one another, swinging their pipes.

28
00:01:41.866 --> 00:01:44.348
Crash! "Ouch!

29
00:01:44.388 --> 00:01:45.309
You hit me!"

30
00:01:45.449 --> 00:01:46.030
cried one.

31
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.832
"Sorry! I didn't—oof!

32
00:01:49.612 --> 00:01:50.733
Who hit my head?"

33
00:01:51.034 --> 00:01:51.554
said another.

34
00:01:51.574 --> 00:01:53.736
"Oops!" said a third.

35
00:01:53.756 --> 00:01:56.398
"I thought you were—ouch!"

36
00:01:57.799 --> 00:02:00.574
As the mole men fought, Roxy glanced around the cave.

37
00:02:01.995 --> 00:02:04.097
She saw tires, pipes, and other items.

38
00:02:04.978 --> 00:02:06.539
She then saw some electrical wire.

39
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.402
She grabbed the wire and quickly tied up the mole men.

40
00:02:16.628 --> 00:02:17.429
us go!"

41
00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:18.570
shouted one mole man.

42
00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.913
"You can't do this to us," cried another.

43
00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:25.728
"The underground belongs to the mole men!"

44
00:02:25.748 --> 00:02:29.291
"You'd better get used to living above ground," said Roxy.

45
00:02:29.311 --> 00:02:32.353
"Because I'm taking you to jail!"

46
00:02:35.475 --> 00:02:38.237
Terrell, Jack, and Mara were walking away from the soccer field.

47
00:02:39.417 --> 00:02:40.958
They heard a rumble and looked back.

48
00:02:42.079 --> 00:02:47.343
The equipment shed popped out of the ground, followed by "Rocket Girl!"

49
00:02:47.543 --> 00:02:48.143
cried Mara.

50
00:02:49.824 --> 00:02:51.706
Later Roxy returned to the soccer field.

51
00:02:52.706 --> 00:02:54.908
Mara, Terrell, and Jack were practicing soccer.

52
00:02:55.928 --> 00:02:57.949
Coach Nicole spotted Roxy and waved.

53
00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:00.609
"Wow!" said Roxy.

54
00:03:00.629 --> 00:03:02.830
"The equipment shed is back!"

55
00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.351
"Guess who found it!"

56
00:03:05.531 --> 00:03:06.171
said Terrell.

57
00:03:06.991 --> 00:03:07.972
"Rocket Girl!"

58
00:03:07.992 --> 00:03:11.713
"Really?" Roxy pretended she didn't know.

59
00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:14.033
"I guess I was wrong, Terrell.

60
00:03:14.674 --> 00:03:17.694
Rocket Girl was able to get the shed out of the ground!"

61
00:03:18.915 --> 00:03:20.615
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

62
00:03:21.856 --> 00:03:22.716
Roxy smiled.

63
00:03:24.085 --> 00:03:26.917
She grabbed a soccer ball and started to dribble it down the field.
